"Hallo {guide}\n"
"\n"
"Du hast eine neue Anfrage erhalten:\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guest_contact}\n"
"\n"
"Tourenwunsch:\n"
"{guest_message}\n"
"\n"
"Bitte antworte bis {deadline}, sonst verfällt die Anfrage:\n"
"{guide_link}"
msgstr ""
"Bonjour {guide}\n"
"\n"
"Tu as reçu une nouvelle demande :\n"
"\n"
"{summary}\n"
"{guest_contact}\n"
"\n"
"Souhait de course :\n"
"{guest_message}\n"
"\n"
"Merci de répondre d’ici le {deadline}, sinon la demande expire :\n"
"{guide_link}"

